message: "If you use these materials in teaching, research, or derived work, please cite as below."
title: "FA511: Drug Formulation and Production A"
abstract: "R and Quarto material for FA511 Drug Formulation and Production A, a 7.5 ECTS bachelor course in pharmacy at the University of Southern Denmark. Students learn to analyse, visualise and report experimental data in R and Quarto: an introduction to R functions for acid/base calculations and to Quarto documents, a guide to standard curves with linear regression, and data processing and report guides for two laboratory exercises (solubilisation of paracetamol, sulfadiazine and ibuprofen, and sedimentation of sulfur suspensions). The guides are written in Danish."
